{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PRBQsUmaYl1792734720.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近日整體市況正面，馬鞍山區本月暫錄約55宗二手成交，與上月同期相若，其中居屋富寶花園佔約3宗，屋苑最新錄1座中層F室，實用面積484平方呎，2房間隔，開價約500萬元，議價後以自由市場價478萬元易手，實用平均呎價9,876元。<br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為用家，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2006年以122萬元購入單位，持貨約20年，是次轉手賬面上獲利約356萬元或292%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:39.385609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T17:38:04.804139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:49.895053+00:00","content_hash":"8d621a9c60b20078ec612bae6e63d17b8c571ff33f65469bfde4c88d71eca401","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:39.385609+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}